Subject: [PATCH 80/80] POC-19g: late-game balance pass - the test bot switches
 after two idle Customs and picks the replacement the foe hurts least; version
 0.19

(The foe's hard stop on stat moves past +2, bombs flying 40 frames instead of 30, the bot's two-step dodge and
PKBN_DEBUG_DMG went in with POC-19j's commit.)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
---
 include/pkbn/version.h |  2 +-
 src/pkbn/bot.c         | 72 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 2 files changed, 69 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/include/pkbn/version.h b/include/pkbn/version.h
index fe1a624..8cb7e4d 100644
